WP05 security and no-claim proof

Negative gates covered by parser tests:
- Inventory evidence is not app/game usage.
- Inventory evidence cannot set running state.
- Inventory evidence cannot set foreground state.
- Inventory evidence cannot set running or foreground duration.
- Launcher-installed inventory is not gameplay evidence.
- Permission-limited and stale states remain explicit instead of being promoted.
- High-confidence display-only metadata is rejected without identity refs.

Non-goals:
- No OS adapter executes in this slice.
- No journal, SQLite, portal, policy, AI, or enforcement runtime consumes these
  rows yet.
- No raw private executable path is added to the new inventory evidence row;
  executable data is represented by refs.
